# Raw local source images for the static-ad template importer (PART 3/4).
# This is only ever an IMPORT SOURCE for
# scripts/brandee-import-static-templates.js — never referenced by the
# running app (the app serves optimized copies from
# public/agents/brandee/assets/templates/imported/ instead, which IS
# committed). Keeping the raw originals out of git avoids bloating the repo
# with ~38MB of source photos that have no runtime purpose.
/Assets/
